{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {\r\n            font-family: 'Cafe24Danjunghae';\r\n            src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_twelve@1.1/Cafe24Danjunghae.woff') format('woff');\r\n            font-weight: normal;\r\n            font-style: normal;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap * {\r\n            box-sizing: border-box;\r\n            word-break: keep-all;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap h1,\r\n        h2,\r\n        h3,\r\n        h4,\r\n        h5,\r\n        h6,\r\n        ul,\r\n        ol,\r\n        li,\r\n        dl,\r\n        dt,\r\n        dd,\r\n        p,\r\n        div,\r\n        span,\r\n        section,\r\n        i {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap ul,\r\n        ol,\r\n        li,\r\n        dl,\r\n        dt,\r\n        dd {\r\n            list-style: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap img {\r\n            width: auto;\r\n            max-width: 100%;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            font-size: 16px;\r\n            font-weight: 400;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 1200px !important;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            padding: 0 0 40px;\r\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            color: #3e3a39;\r\n            line-height: 1.4;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 공통 */\r\n        .product_detail_wrap h2 {\r\n            font-size: 3.75em;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap h3 {\r\n            font-size: 1.875em;\r\n            margin-top: 30px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p0 {\r\n            font-size: 1.125em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p1 {\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p2 {\r\n            font-size: 1.875em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p3 {\r\n            font-size: 2.25em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p4 {\r\n            font-size: 3em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .p5 {\r\n            font-size: 3.75em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap p span,\r\n        .product_detail_wrap h3 span,\r\n        .product_detail_wrap h4 span {\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_10 {\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_20 {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {\r\n            margin-top: 30px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_40 {\r\n            margin-top: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_60 {\r\n            margin-top: 60px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .mt_120 {\r\n            margin-top: 120px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .fw_500 {\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .fw_600 {\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .tl {\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .color_green {\r\n            color: #6eaa5e;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .color_white {\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .color_gray {\r\n            color: #9fa0a0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .color_red {\r\n            color: #df0000;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .green_bg {\r\n            background-color: #4fb534;\r\n            padding: 0 0.4em 0.1em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .gray_bg {\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f3;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 키이미지 */\r\n        .product_key_img {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            margin: 0 !important;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 5.3077%;\r\n            left: 6.5%;\r\n            width: 87%;\r\n            font-family: 'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;\r\n            color: #121212;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt .logo {\r\n            width: 230px;\r\n            margin: 0 0 3.7%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt .text_01 {\r\n            font-size: 2.2em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt .text_02 {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            font-size: 5.5em;\r\n            letter-spacing: 0.2px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt .text_02 span {\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt .text_02 img {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            width: 190px;\r\n            top: 0.8em;\r\n            left: 3.7em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt_bottom {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            bottom: 45.0769%;\r\n            left: 6.5%;\r\n            width: 87%;\r\n            font-family: 'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt_bottom .text_03 {\r\n            font-size: 3em;\r\n            margin-bottom: 1%;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_key_img .key_txt_bottom .text_04 {\r\n            font-size: 2.2em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 디엘릭서 그린으로 */\r\n        .cont_01 {\r\n            background-color: #abd184;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_01 .txt_box {\r\n            padding-top: 100px;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 자가진단테스트 */\r\n        .cont_02 {\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f3;\r\n            padding: 120px 0 100px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .check_point {\r\n            width: 75%;\r\n            margin: 50px auto 0;\r\n            border-top: #6eaa5e 4px solid;\r\n            border-bottom: #6eaa5e 4px solid;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .check_point li {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            width: 98%;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            line-height: 76px;\r\n            border-bottom: #868686 3px dotted;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .check_point li:last-of-type {\r\n            border-bottom: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .check_point li p {\r\n            font-size: 1.875em;\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .check_point li input {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            right: 0;\r\n            width: 36px;\r\n            height: 36px;\r\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .img_box {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_02 .img_box .txt_box {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            width:100%;\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            left:0;\r\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 디엘릭서 그린의 특별함 */\r\n        .cont_03 {}\r\n\r\n        .cont_03 .cont_box {\r\n            width: 82%;\r\n            margin: 80px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_03 .cont_box .num_box li {\r\n            border-bottom: #e6e6e6 2px solid;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: flex-start;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_03 .cont_box .num_box li .img_box {\r\n            width: 90px;\r\n            margin-right: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cont_03 .cont_box .num_box li:last-of-type {\r\n            border-bottom: none;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT TITLE */\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .point_num {\r\n            font-family: Cafe24Danjunghae;\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n            border: #101010 1px solid;\r\n            font-size: 2.25em;\r\n            border-radius: 50px;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 15px 30px 10px;\r\n            letter-spacing: 0;\r\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .product_detail_wrap .sub_title {\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n            border: #727171 1px solid;\r\n            border-radius: 50px;\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 9px 35px 10px;\r\n            margin: 15px auto 0;\r\n            color: #727171;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 01 */\r\n        .point_01 {\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f3;\r\n            padding: 100px 0 120px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_01 {\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin: 90px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 28.5%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            row-gap: 60px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 {\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 60px auto 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .title_box {\r\n            background-color: #6eaa5e;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            line-height: 7.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box {\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 46% 1px 46%;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n            border: #c9caca 1px solid;\r\n            border-top: none;\r\n            padding: 60px 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box p {\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box .line {\r\n            height: 100%;\r\n            border-left: #bfc0c0 1px solid;\r\n            width: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box .list_t {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: flex-start;\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n            color: #898989;\r\n            margin-top: 30px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box .list_t p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            margin-left: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 02 */\r\n        .point_02 {}\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .img_box {\r\n            width: 82%;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            margin: 70px auto 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .img_box div {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .img_box div:nth-of-type(1) {\r\n            width: 24.5%;\r\n            bottom: 0;\r\n            left: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .img_box div:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .img_box div:nth-of-type(3) {\r\n            width: 24.5%;\r\n            bottom: 0;\r\n            right: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .txt_box {\r\n            width: 75%;\r\n            margin: 80px auto 0;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 유기농이란? */\r\n        .point_02 .cont_box_01 {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            margin: 120px 0 80px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            width: 75%;\r\n            top: 120px;\r\n            left: 12.5%;\r\n            color: #000;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box .organic {\r\n            margin-top: 70px;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 20%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box .organic div {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box .organic div p {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            left: 0;\r\n            transform: translateY(-50%);\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 03 */\r\n        .point_03 {\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f3;\r\n            padding: 100px 0 120px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_03 .img_box {\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 100px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 31%);\r\n            justify-content: space-evenly;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .point_03 .img_box .title_box {\r\n            background-color: #4fb534;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            border-radius: 50px;\r\n            padding: 14px 10px;\r\n            font-size: 1.875em;\r\n            margin-top: 40px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* POINT 04 */\r\n        .point_04 {}\r\n\r\n        .point_04 .img_box {\r\n            width: 74%;\r\n            margin: 100px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 24%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 이런 분께 권합니다! */\r\n        .elixir_recommend {\r\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\r\n            padding: 100px 0 120px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_recommend .cont_box {\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin: 70px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 26% 74%;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_recommend .cont_box .txt_box {\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: 7% 1fr;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            gap: 30px 5px;\r\n            letter-spacing: -1px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 디엘릭서 프로그램 가이드 */\r\n        .elixir_guide {}\r\n\r\n        .elixir_guide .guide_table {\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 40px auto 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_guide .guide_table thead th {\r\n            background-color: #2f2725;\r\n            vertical-align: middle;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n            padding: 25px 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_guide .guide_table tbody th {\r\n            border: 1px solid #9e9a98;\r\n            vertical-align: middle;\r\n            font-weight: normal;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_guide .guide_table td {\r\n            border: 1px solid #9e9a98;\r\n            padding: 25px 0;\r\n            vertical-align: middle;\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 프로그램 팁 */\r\n        .elixir_tip {\r\n            margin: 120px auto;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box {\r\n            width: 80%;\r\n            margin: 50px auto 0;\r\n            background-color: #f2f2f3;\r\n            padding: 50px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box .list_t {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: flex-start;\r\n            font-size: 1.5em;\r\n            color: #000;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box .list_t_s {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: flex-start;\r\n            font-size: 1.125em;\r\n            color: #000;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box .list_t_s p:nth-of-type(1) {\r\n            padding-left: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box .list_t p:nth-of-type(2),\r\n        .elixir_tip .txt_box .list_t_s p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            margin-left: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 섭취방법 */\r\n        .ingestion {\r\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\r\n            padding: 100px 0 120px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .cont_box {\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 80px auto 0;\r\n            display: grid;\r\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 30%);\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            align-items: start;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .txt_box {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 40px auto 0;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n            background: linear-gradient(to top, #fff 75%, #f4f4f4 25%);\r\n            padding: 0 160px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .txt_box .txt_item {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 50%;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            color: #00aa87;\r\n            transform: translate(-25%, -15%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .txt_box .txt_item span {\r\n            color: #11f692;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .elixir_noti {\r\n            position: relative;\r\n            width: 85%;\r\n            margin: 120px auto 0;\r\n            border: #3e3a39 5px solid;\r\n            padding: 90px 60px 60px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .ingestion .elixir_noti img {\r\n            position: absolute;\r\n            top: 0;\r\n            left: 50%;\r\n            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n        .brand_story {\r\n            width: 90%;\r\n            padding: 30px;\r\n            margin: 120px auto 0;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n            justify-content: space-between;\r\n            border: #e1e1e1 solid 1px;\r\n            border-radius: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_img {\r\n            width: 40%;\r\n            border-radius: 10px;\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_info {\r\n            width: 56%;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_info img {\r\n            max-width: 40%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_info p {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 1em;\r\n            font-weight: 300;\r\n            color: #666;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_info p span {\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n            color: #121212;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .brand_story .brand_story_info>p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 15px;\r\n                padding: 0 0 3.5vw;\r\n                overflow: hidden;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap h3 {\r\n                margin-top: 2.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_10 {\r\n                margin-top: 0.83vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_20 {\r\n                margin-top: 1.66vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {\r\n                margin-top: 2.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_40 {\r\n                margin-top: 3.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_60 {\r\n                margin-top: 5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_120 {\r\n                margin-top: 10vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_key_img .key_txt .logo {\r\n                width: 19vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_key_img .key_txt .text_02 img {\r\n                width: 15.83vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_01 .txt_box {\r\n                padding-top: 8.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_02 {\r\n                padding: 10vw 0 8.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_02 .check_point {\r\n                margin: 4.16vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_02 .check_point li input {\r\n                width: 3vw;\r\n                height: 3vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_03 .cont_box {\r\n                margin: 6.5vw auto 0;\r\n                grid-template-columns: 25vw 1fr;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_03 .cont_box .num_box li .img_box {\r\n                width: 7.5vw;\r\n                margin-right: 3.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .point_num {\r\n                margin-bottom: 2.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 {\r\n                padding: 8.33vw 0 10vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 .cont_box_01 {\r\n                margin: 7.5vw auto 0;\r\n                row-gap: 5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 .cont_box_02 {\r\n                margin: 5vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box {\r\n                padding: 5vw 3.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box .list_t {\r\n                margin-top: 2.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_01 .cont_box_02 .txt_box .list_t p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n                margin-left: 0.41vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .img_box {\r\n                margin: 5.83vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .txt_box {\r\n                margin: 6.5vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .cont_box_01 {\r\n                margin: 10vw 0 6.5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box {\r\n                top: 10vw;\r\n                width: 80%;\r\n                left: 10%;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .cont_box_01 .in_box .organic {\r\n                margin-top: 5.83vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_02 .mid_img {\r\n                width: 86.6vw;\r\n                margin: 0 auto;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_03 {\r\n                padding: 8.33vw 0 10vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_03 .img_box {\r\n                margin: 8.33vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_03 .img_box .title_box {\r\n                padding: 1.16vw 0.83vw;\r\n                margin-top: 3.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .point_04 .img_box {\r\n                margin: 8.33vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_recommend {\r\n                padding: 8.33vw 0 10vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_recommend .cont_box {\r\n                margin: 5.83vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_recommend .cont_box .txt_box {\r\n                gap: 2.5vw 5px;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_guide .guide_table {\r\n                margin: 3.33vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_guide .guide_table thead th {\r\n                padding: 2.1vw 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_guide .guide_table td {\r\n                padding: 2.1vw 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_tip {\r\n                margin: 10vw auto;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_tip .txt_box {\r\n                margin: 4.16vw auto 0;\r\n                padding: 4.16vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion {\r\n                padding: 8.33vw 0 10vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .cont_box {\r\n                margin: 6.5vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .txt_box {\r\n                margin: 3.33vw auto 0;\r\n                padding: 0 13.33vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .txt_box img {\r\n                width: 11vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .txt_box .txt_item {\r\n                transform: translate(-15%, -15%);\r\n                width: 100%;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .elixir_noti {\r\n                margin: 10vw auto 0;\r\n                padding: 7.5vw 5vw 5vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .elixir_noti img {\r\n                width: 11vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .brand_story {\r\n                padding: 2.5vw;\r\n                margin: 10vw auto 0;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .brand_story .brand_story_info p {\r\n                margin-top: 1.66vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .brand_story .brand_story_info>p:nth-of-type(2) {\r\n                margin-top: 0.83vw;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .nbr {\r\n                display: none;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:1080px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 14px;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .elixir_recommend .cont_box .txt_box {\r\n                align-items: start;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .txt_box .txt_item {\r\n                transform: translate(-15%, -18%);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:860px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 13px;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .cont_02 .check_point {\r\n                width: 90%;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .ingestion .txt_box .txt_item {\r\n                transform: translate(-15%, -20%);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 12px;\r\n                word-break: break-all;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            .brand_story {\r\n                align-items: flex-start;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:680px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 10px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:580px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 9px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        @media all and (max-width:560px) {\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {\r\n                font-size: 8px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"product_detail_wrap\">\n<section class=\"product_key_img tl\">\n<div class=\"key_txt\">\n<div class=\"logo\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/gcoop_the_elixir_logo.png\"/></div>\n<p class=\"text_01\">라이프 스타일에 따라 달라지는 나만의 묘약 레시피</p>\n<p class=\"text_02\"><span>디엘릭서</span> 그린<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green.png\"/></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"key_txt_bottom\">\n<p class=\"text_03\">바디 리셋이 필요할 때!</p>\n<p class=\"text_04\">“이너뷰티를 위한<br/>\r\n데일리 클렌즈 프로젝트”</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/gcoop_the_elixir_green_key_img.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"cont_01\">\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<p class=\"p4\">디엘릭서 <span class=\"green_bg\">그린으로</span></p>\n<h2>더 기대되는 내일의 나!</h2>\n<p class=\"p4 mt_40\">“관리의 시작은 <span>몸을 비우는 것부터</span>”</p>\n<p class=\"p3 mt_40\">가벼워지고 싶은 마음은 가득하지만<br/>\r\n바쁜 일상 속에 쉽지 않은 나날들.<br/>\r\n간편하고 맛있게 클린한 나를 만나보세요!</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_img_01.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"cont_02\">\n<p class=\"p3 fw_500\">자가진단테스트</p>\n<h2>독소, 내 몸에 얼마나 있을까?</h2>\n<ul class=\"check_point tl\">\n<li>\n<p>늘 피곤하다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>눈이 침침하고 소화가 잘 안된다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>잇몸에서 피가 나고 헛구역질이 난다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>술을 자주 마시며 폭주를 한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>약을 오랫동안 복용하고 있다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>지방간이 있다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>복부비만이 있다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>특정한 음식에 알러지가 있다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>피부에 트러블이 잦다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>입에서 냄새가 나고 방귀나 대변에 독한 냄새가 난다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>변비 또는 설사 등 대변이 불규칙하다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>위가 더부룩하고 소화가 자주 안된다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>스트레스에 약하고 지나치게 졸리다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>자주 붓거나 헛배가 부르다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>여러곳이 자주 아프고 쑤신다.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_20\">* 본 체크리스트는 단순 참고용이며, 의학적 진단이나 치료와 무관합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"img_box\">\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<p class=\"p2\">증상 중 2-3개 이상에 해당하면</p>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600\">클렌징으로 <span class=\"color_green\">바디 리셋</span>이 필요합니다.</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_img_02_mod.jpg\"/></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cont_03 mt_120\">\n<h2>디엘릭서 <span class=\"color_green\">그린</span>의 특별함</h2>\n<div class=\"cont_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_03_00.jpg\"/>\n<ul class=\"num_box\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"img_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_03_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>확실한 클렌즈 효과</span>의 원료 배합</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"img_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_03_02.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>애플사이다비니거&amp;콤부차</span>로 시너지효과</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"img_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_03_03.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>식물 유래 파이토 뉴트리언트</span> 원료 함유</p>\n</li>\n\n<li>\n<div class=\"img_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_03_04.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>청포도맛</span>으로 맛있게 섭취!</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"point_01 mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 01</div>\n<h2>바디 클렌즈를 위한 황금 배합</h2>\n<h3>믿을 수 있는 프리미엄 원료로<br/>\r\n더욱 강력한 클렌즈 효과와 확실한 가벼움을 느껴보세요!</h3>\n<div class=\"cont_box_01\">\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>레몬</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>레드자몽</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_03.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>애플사이다비니거 *</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_04.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>콤부차 *</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_05.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>치커리</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_06.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_30\"><span>효모</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"cont_box_02\">\n<div class=\"title_box\">\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600\">부가정보</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_07.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_40\"><span>* 애플사이다비니거</span>(사과초모식초)</p>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>최근 할리우드 연예인들 많이 섭취한다고 알려짐</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>사과즙을 자연 발효한 전통적 방식의 식초를 의미</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>사과식초로 바뀔때 생기는 초모는 유산균, 효소 등이 함유되어 디톡스나 소화촉진 등의 효과</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line\"> </div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_04_08.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_40\"><span>* 콤부차</span></p>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>마돈나와 미란다 커 등 헐리우드 스타들이 즐겨마셔 유명세를 타기 시작</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>녹차나 홍차에 원당을 첨가해 발효시켜 얻은 원료</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>미생물, 효모, 글루쿠론산 등을 풍부하게 함유하고 있어 건강상의 이점에 대한 연구도 다수 이뤄짐</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_40\">* 제품에 대한 설명이 아닌 원물에 대한 설명입니다.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"point_02 mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 02</div>\n<h2>엄선한 유기농 파이토 뉴트리언트</h2>\n<div class=\"img_box\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>Phyto</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">식물</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span>Phytonutrient</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 color_gray\">파이토 뉴트리언트</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>Nutrient</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">영양소</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_01.jpg\"/></div>\n\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<p class=\"p4\"><span>파이토 뉴트리언트?</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">Phyto(Plant:식물)와 Nutrient(영양소)의 합성어 입니다. 즉, 식물만이 가지고 있는<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n고유한 영양소를 의미합니다. 파이토 뉴트리언트는 자외선과 같은 외부공격, 물리적인<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n스트레스, 산화 등으로부터 식물 자신을 보호하기 위해서 만들어내는 생리활성물질<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n입니다.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"cont_box_01\">\n<div class=\"in_box\">\n<p class=\"p4 tl\"><span>유기농 이란?</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 tl mt_20\">3년 이상 농약과 화학비료를 일절 사용하지 않은 땅에서 재배해야지만 유기농입니다.<br/>\r\n건강에 좋다고 알려진 이름난 야채라도 척박한 땅에서 다량의 비료와 농약으로<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n길러졌다면 오히려 건강에 해로울 수 있습니다. 비옥한 땅에서 비료와 농약 없이<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n길러졌는지, 믿을만한 유기농 작물인지 반드시 확인해야 합니다!</p>\n<div class=\"organic\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">질소비료</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_04.png\"/></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">칼륨비료</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_04.png\"/></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">인산비료</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_04.png\"/></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">살충제</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_04.png\"/></div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600\">제초제</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_04.png\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_02.jpg\"/></div>\n<img class=\"mid_img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_05_03.jpg\"/> \n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600\">영양 손실을 줄이기 위해 선택한,<br/>\n<span class=\"color_green\">원적외선 저온건조!</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">먹기 불편해 버려지는 뿌리와 껍질, 뜨거운 열을 가하는 조리과정 속에서 야채의 핵심<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n영양소는 손실 됩니다. 디엘릭서에 함유된 유기농 파이토 뉴트리언트 원료는 뿌리부터<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n껍질까지 야채의 모든 영양을 지키기 위한 최적의 건조 공법인 원적외선 저온건조를<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n택했습니다! 영양소 손실은 최소화 하고 보관은 더 오래 가능한 원적외선 저온건조<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n공법으로 뿌리부터 껍질까지 건조!</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"point_03 mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 03</div>\n<h2>부원료까지 확실하게</h2>\n<div class=\"img_box\">\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_06_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"title_box\"><span>장 건강 부스팅</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_10\"><span>17종 혼합유산균, 푸룬과즙분말</span></p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_06_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"title_box\"><span>피부 건강 부스팅</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_10\"><span>콜라겐, L-글루타치온, 엘라스틴</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p0 mt_60\"><span>* 제품에 대한 설명이 아닌 원물에 대한 설명입니다.</span></p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"point_04 mt_120\">\n<div class=\"point_num\">Point 04</div>\n<h2>우려 성분 무첨가</h2>\n<h3>설탕과 인공색소, 인공 방부제를 포함해 우려되는 성분은<br/>\r\n사용하지 않았습니다!</h3>\n<div class=\"img_box\">\n<div class=\"item_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_07_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 mt_20\">인공색소</p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span>0%</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_07_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 mt_20\">방부제</p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span>0%</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_07_03.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 mt_20\">유제품</p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span>0%</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_07_04.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2 fw_500 mt_20\">글루텐</p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span>0%</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"elixir_recommend mt_120\">\n<h2>이런 분께 권합니다!</h2>\n<div class=\"cont_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"txt_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08_bull.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>과일, 채소 섭취</span>가 부족하신 분</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08_bull.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>장에 쌓인 노폐물</span>을 원활하게 배출하고 싶으신 분</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08_bull.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>무겁고 찌뿌듯한 내 몸을 디톡스</span>하고 싶으신 분</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08_bull.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>평소 인스턴트 식품이나 간편식</span>을 자주 섭취하시는 분</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_08_bull.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span>일상에서 데일리 바디리셋</span>을 원하시는 분</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"elixir_guide mt_120\">\n<h2>디엘릭서 프로그램 가이드</h2>\n<p class=\"sub_title\">The Elixir Program Guide</p>\n\n<table class=\"guide_table\">\n<colgroup>\n<col/>\n<col style=\"width:18%;\"/>\n<col style=\"width:24%;\"/>\n<col style=\"width:18%;\"/>\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">STEP</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">TIME</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">PRODUCT</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">WATER</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"4\">\n<p><span class=\"p4 color_red\">3</span><span class=\"p2\">일 비움</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">가벼운 몸을 위한 시작</p>\n</th>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">기상</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">그린 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>아침</td>\n<td>그린 1포</td>\n<td>200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">점심</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">레드 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">500ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>저녁</td>\n<td>그린 2포</td>\n<td>500ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"6\">\n<p><span class=\"p4 color_red\">3</span><span class=\"p2\">일 채움</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">최적의 건강을 위한 영양 채움</p>\n</th>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">기상</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">그린 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>아침</td>\n<td>그린 1포</td>\n<td>200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\" rowspan=\"2\">점심</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\" colspan=\"2\">가벼운 식사</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">레드 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">500ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">저녁</td>\n<td>그린 1포</td>\n<td>200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">가벼운 식사</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"6\">\n<p><span class=\"p4 color_red\">3</span><span class=\"p2\">일 균형</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">균형 잡힌 영양 섭취로<br/>\r\n\t\t\t새롭게 바디 리셋</p>\n</th>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">기상</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">그린 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>아침</td>\n<td>그린 1포</td>\n<td>200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\" rowspan=\"2\">점심</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\" colspan=\"2\">일반 식사</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">레드 1포</td>\n<td class=\"gray_bg\">500ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">저녁</td>\n<td>그린 1포</td>\n<td>200ml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">가벼운 식사</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"elixir_tip\">\n<h2>프로그램 팁</h2>\n<p class=\"sub_title\">Program Tip</p>\n<div class=\"txt_box\">\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>추가로 물 500 ml 를 수시로 나눠서 섭취해주세요</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>개인의 컨디션에 따라 1포를 2포로 늘려 섭취하실 수 있습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>어린이, 임산부, 카페인 민감자는 디엘릭서 레드 섭취를 권장 드리지 않습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>가벼운 식사에는 디톡스의 원활함을 위해 염분과 칼로리는 낮고 포만감이 높은 음식이<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n해당됩니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t_s\">\n<p>예시)</p>\n<p>제너럴 밸런스 프로틴 포뮬러 1포, 채소 위주의 식단, 잡곡밥, 계란 3개&amp;식빵 1조각 맑은 죽, 고구마 2개,<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n그릭요거트, 오트밀 죽 등</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_t\">\n<p>˙</p>\n<p>디톡스 기간에는 가급적 금주해 주시고 칼로리가 너무 높은 음식이나 염분이 높은<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n음식은 피해주세요.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_img.jpg\"/> \n<section class=\"ingestion\">\n<h2>섭취방법</h2>\n<div class=\"cont_box\">\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_09_01.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">보틀에 200 ml 이상의<br/>\r\n시원한 물을 넣어주세요</p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_09_02.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">디엘릭서 그린 1포를 넣고<br/>\r\n섞어주세요. (기호에따라<br/>\r\n물 양을 조절해서 드세요)</p>\n</div>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_09_03.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">고유의 배합으로 완성된 맛을<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n즐기세요!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"txt_box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_09_04.png\"/>\n<div class=\"txt_item\">\n<p class=\"p2\">탄산수, 얼음에 타서 드시면<br/>\n<span>청포도에이드</span> 처럼 드실 수 있습니다!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"elixir_noti\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/the_elixir_green/the_elixir_green_10.png\"/>\n<h2>제품의 이상이 아닙니다!</h2>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">과일, 아채 등 파이토 뉴트리언트 원료가 함유되어 있어<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n바로 섭취 하지 않을 경우 층 분리가 있을 수 있으나<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n제품의 이상이 아닙니다.<br/>\r\n섭취 전 다시 한번 흔들어 섞은 후 섭취해주세요!</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<div class=\"brand_story\">\n<div class=\"brand_story_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/new_package/brand_story/brand_gcoop_the_elixir_img.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"brand_story_info\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/new_package/brand_story/brand_elixir_logo.png\"/>\n<p><span>“진정한 아름다움을 완성하기 위해서는 내면의 근본적인 변화가 필요하다”</span></p>\n<p>디엘릭서는 개개인의 라이프 스타일에 맞춰 아름다움을 건강하게 디자인하고 생활 전반에 걸쳐 Beautiful Living &amp; Aging 이 실현될 수 있도록 늘 더 좋은 방법을 고민하고 제시합니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://vcshop.gcoop.com/images/icon_edu_materials.png\" style=\"width:220px;\"/></a>\n</div>\n</div>","info":[["제품명 / 제품 코드","디엘릭서 그린"],["식품의 유형","기타가공품"],["생산자 및 소재지(수입품의 경우 생산자, 수입자 및 제조국)","(제조원) ㈜희망그린식품 경기도 안성시 일죽면 국동길 73-27\n(유통전문판매원) 제너럴바이오㈜ 전북남원시 송동면 용투산로 254"],["제조연월일(포장일 또는 생산연도), 유통기한 또는 소비기한(품질 유지기한)","제품에 별도 표기"],["포장단위별 용량(중량), 수량","10 g * 30 포(300 g)"],["원재료명 및 함량(농수산물의 원산지 표시에 관한 법률에 따른 원산지 표시 포함)","치커리뿌리추출물(벨기에산), D-소비톨, 레몬라임농축분말[덱스트린, 레몬농축액(레몬:이스라엘산), 라임 농축액(라임:이탈리아산)], 유기농발효콤부차분말[홍차추출액{유기농홍차엽(국산)} 51.6 %, 유기농말토덱스트린 25%, 유기농현미콤부차{현미(국산)} 21%, 콤부차복합영양원 2.4%] 5%, 무수구연산, 정제소금, 레드자몽농축분말, 청사과 향분말(혼합제제)[포도당, 이산화규소, 향료1(사과향), 향료2(사과향)], 사과초모식초분말, 제주말차분말, 혼합제제(덱 스트린, 치자황색소, 치자청색소), DL-사과산, 저분자피쉬콜라겐, L-아르기닌, 파이토과일야채혼합발효분말, 청 (풋)사과맛분말, 청포도맛분말, 유기농케일분말 0.2%, 유기농울금분말 0.2%, 유기농시금치분말 0.2%, 유기농샐 러리분말 0.2%, 유기농생강분말 0.2%, 유기농새싹보리분말 0.2%, 유기농밀싹분말 0.2%, 유기농마늘분말 0.2%, 탄산수소나트륨, 탄산마그네슘, 수크랄로스(감미료), 효소처리스테비아, 17종유산균혼합분말, 푸룬농축분말, 효모 추출물(L-글루타치온 50%), 잔탄검, 엘라스틴가수분해물, 우유, 대두, 토마토, 복숭아 함유"],["영양성분 (식품위생법에 따른 영양성분 표시대상 식품에 한함)","1회 제공량 : 1포(10 g)\n1회 제공량 당 함량 : 열량  35 kcal, 탄수화물 9 g(3 %), 단백질 0 g(0 %), 지방 0.7 g(1 %), 나트륨 95 mg(5 %), 콜레스테롤 0 mg(0 %)"],["섭취량, 섭취방법","1포 기준 물 200 ml에 넣고 흔드신 후 섭취하십시오.(기호에 따라 물 양 조절 가능)"],["섭취 시 주의사항 및 부작용 가능성","1. 소비기한을 확인 후 섭취하시기 바라며 섭취량 및 섭취방법을 준수하시기 바랍니다.\n2. 특이체질이신분은 성분을 확인한 후 섭취하시기 바랍니다.\n3. 스틱포 개봉 후에는 변질이 생길 수 있으니 가급적 빨리 섭취하십시오.\n4. 과량 섭취 시 설사를 일으킬 수 있으니 주의하십시오."],["유전자변형식","해당없음"],["수입식품에 해당하는 경우 \"식품위생법에 따른 수입신고를 필함\"의 문구","해당없음"],["소비자 상담관련 전화번호","02-555-6009\n지쿱 홈페이지(www.gcoop.com) 하단 소비자 상담센터 이용"]]}